# Delegate — Procedure

## Goal

```
Use the explicitly configured instrukt fallback for the missing native capability.
```

```
Use native child/task messaging or continuation for the supplied child id. Within an outstanding attempt, relay the bounded follow-up under that role/attempt. For a newly reserved attempt, bind that attempt to the child id through instrukt first, then send its rendered brief to the child's thread (t3_thread_send, keeping the thread's context); the child works the round under the new role/attempt. Continue an idle or finished child through the same native continuation.
```

